            "description": "## Create Trip Request\n\nThis endpoint allows users to create a new trip in the system. By providing specific details about the trip, users can initiate a request for assistance.\n\n### Request Parameters\n\nThe request must include the following parameters in the form-data body:\n\n- **customer_id** (string): A unique identifier for the customer requesting the trip.\n    \n- **pickup_latitude** (string): The latitude coordinate for the pickup location.\n    \n- **pickup_longitude** (string): The longitude coordinate for the pickup location.\n    \n- **type** (string): The type of trip being requested (e.g., standard, premium).\n    \n\n### Response Structure\n\nUpon a successful request, the API will return a response that includes details about the created trip. The structure of the response will typically contain information such as the trip ID, status, and any other relevant details associated with the trip.\n\nEnsure that all parameters are provided correctly to avoid errors in trip creation."
