            "description": "## Update Status Trip\n\nUpdates the status of a specific trip. This endpoint allows updating trip progress by setting the current status along with the associated driver.\n\n---\n\n### Endpoint\n\n**Method:** `PATCH`\n**URL:** `https://road-assist.test/api/v1/trips/1/status`\n\n---\n\n### Request Headers\n\n| Header | Value |\n|---|---|\n| `Accept` | `application/json` |\n| `Content-Type` | `application/json` |\n\n---\n\n### Request Body\n\n**Body Type:** `multipart/form-data`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `driver_id` | integer | ✅ | The ID of the driver associated with the trip. **Example:** `2` |\n| `status` | string | ✅ | The new status of the trip. **Possible values:** `started`, `completed`, `arrived` |\n\n---\n\n### Example Response\n\n**Status:** `200 OK`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"status\": \"completed\",\n    \"type\": \"normal\",\n    \"pickup\": {\n      \"latitude\": 24.4539,\n      \"longitude\": 54.3773\n    },\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22 20:10:14\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### Response Fields\n\n| Field | Type | Description |\n|---|---|---|\n| `data.id` | integer | The unique identifier of the trip |\n| `data.status` | string | The updated status of the trip |\n| `data.type` | string | The type of the trip (e.g., `normal`) |\n| `data.pickup.latitude` | float | Latitude of the pickup location |\n| `data.pickup.longitude` | float | Longitude of the pickup location |\n| `data.created_at` | string | Timestamp when the trip was created |"
          },
